            "value": "Walks serenely down 3-2-1-7-6-5 before lifting back home — a golden chord backbone spanning centuries."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3-2-1-7↓-6↓-5↓-6↓-7↓——稳步下沉再轻轻回扬的骨架，古典与现代共鸣的经典地基。"
